//! Construction of external snapshots from observed Kbuild actions.
//!
//! The observer supplies exact process bytes and filesystem observations. This
//! module roots those values, cross-checks them against Kbuild's own `.cmd`
//! receipt, and constructs the generic external-analysis snapshot used by
//! Make-free replay. It does not parse or evaluate shell or Make syntax.

