/// Eligibility proof for an opaque isolated must-execute action contract.
///
/// Every action named by the procfs policy has a complete captured-input
/// partition: stable external seeds, exact final generated-file values,
/// enforceable generated-directory checkpoints, or reads following its own
/// mutation candidate. Every captured mutation is below the one output root
/// and is partitioned into declared persistent and action-owned transient
/// paths. The private contract retains exact input values and a
/// [`rush_exec::local_isolation::LocalExecutionIsolation`] whose only writable
/// root is that output root.
