/// Stable values following every declared persistent-output mutation.
///
/// Each selected descriptor final-value observation belongs to the declaring
/// action and follows that path's last supported mutation in global stream
/// order. A path
/// published by the final captured atomic rename may instead use a stable
/// post-capture current-path witness. Graph output positions keep private paths
/// out of the public result. This remains non-authorizing: the post-capture
/// witness may bind a regular file, the raw target of a symbolic link, or a
/// created directory's identity and mode. Directories become initial replay
/// namespace state, never recursive cached trees. The witness cannot contribute
/// replay authority until uncaptured writers and complete initial and final
/// namespace provenance are excluded.
